  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "RAINTDM",
      "page": "",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2024",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Originally designed by the engineers of Mezeporta, Tonfas are twin weapons propelled by internal steam mechanisms. They grant unprecedented aerial agility and the ability to accumulate pressure with every impact, only to release it later in a devastating explosion. They are complex tools that demand a constant rhythm—dancing between agile evasions and planting your feet to deliver bone-crushing blows.</p><p><a href=\"https://amellwind-mh-dn-d5e-foundry-toolbox-2.vercel.app/weapons?weapon=Tonfas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Tonfas in the Toolbox</a></p><hr><h3>Features</h3><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery Note (Nick)</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p><p>When you make the extra attack of the Light property, you can make it as part of the Attack action instead of as a Bonus Action. You can make this extra attack only once per turn.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Spirit Gauge</strong></p><p>The weapon builds up internal pressure through combat. Whenever you hit a creature with a melee attack using this weapon, you gain 1 Spirit Charge (up to the maximum of 2). You lose all accumulated charges if you spend 1 minute out of combat or without making an attack.</p><div style=\"margin:0.45em 0 0.1em 0.35em;padding:0.4em 0.55em;border-left:2px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:0 3px 3px 0\"><p>▸ Upgrade — <strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Spirit Gauge Upgrade I</strong></p><p>You can store a maximum of 3 charges.</p></div></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Tonfa Styles</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p><p>Tonfas feature a mechanism that alters their center of gravity. You can use your Bonus Action to change your Tonfa style. Once you choose a style, you remain in it until you decide to change it again or ending as free action:</p><ul><li>Sky Style: The weapon flows with your movements, and short bursts from the thrusters allow you to glide over obstacles. While in this stance, you ignore difficult terrain, and moving through a hostile creature's space does not cost you extra movement.</li><li>Earth Style: The weight and pressure shift to the striking ends. The weapon's damage die increases to [[/r 1d10]], but the massive recoil is so heavy that your walking speed is halved while you remain in this stance.</li></ul></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Spirit Burst</strong></p><p>When you hit a creature with a melee attack using this weapon, you can open the pressure valves. You can expend any number of Spirit Charges you currently have to add [[/r 1d4]] Force damage to that attack.</p><div style=\"margin:0.45em 0 0.1em 0.35em;padding:0.4em 0.55em;border-left:2px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:0 3px 3px 0\"><p>▸ Upgrade — <strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Spirit Burst Upgrade I</strong></p><p>Your Spirit Burst increases to [[/r 1d6]] Force damage per charge expended.</p></div></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Sky Step</strong></p><p>While in Sky Style, when you make a running or standing jump, you can expend 1 Spirit Charge to double your jump distance (both horizontal and vertical) for that jump.</p></div>",
      "chat": "<p>Originally designed by the engineers of Mezeporta, Tonfas are twin weapons propelled by internal steam mechanisms. They grant unprecedented aerial agility and the ability to accumulate pressure with every impact, only to release it later in a devastating explosion. They are complex tools that demand a constant rhythm—dancing between agile evasions and planting your feet to deliver bone-crushing blows.</p><hr><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery Note (Nick)</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Spirit Gauge</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0.2em 0 0 0.35em\">▸ <strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Spirit Gauge Upgrade I</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Tonfa Styles</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Spirit Burst</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0.2em 0 0 0.35em\">▸ <strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Spirit Burst Upgrade I</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Sky Step</strong></p></div>"
    },
